{"id":"bc-072","statement":"The `in` check narrows `pet` to the member that has `swim`.","truth":true,"explanation":"`in` is a recognised guard for object unions, so the `else` branch is `Bird`. Because it tests property presence, it suits unions with no shared discriminant field.","level":"intermediate","category":"typescript","subject":"narrowing","codeSnippet":"type Fish = { swim(): void };\ntype Bird = { fly(): void };\nfunction move(pet: Fish | Bird) {\n  if (\"swim\" in pet) pet.swim();\n  else pet.fly();\n}","codeLanguage":"typescript","codeHtml":"<span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">type</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> Fish</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#50FA7B\">swim</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">()</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> };</span><br><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">type</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> Bird</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#50FA7B\">fly</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">()</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> };</span><br><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">function</span><span style=\"color:#50FA7B\"> move</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">(</span><span style=\"color:#FFB86C;font-style:italic\">pet</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">:</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> Fish</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> Bird</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">) {</span><br><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#F1FA8C\">swim</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> pet) pet.</span><span style=\"color:#50FA7B\">swim</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">();</span><br><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">  else</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> pet.</span><span style=\"color:#50FA7B\">fly</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">();</span><br><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">}</span>"}